# Costume Closet: a creature is judged as it last existed (CR 603.10a, 700.9), and an Equipment destroyed earlier is no longer
# attached then (CR 400.7). Bot2 Disenchants the Paradise Mantle on Bot1's Ornithopter, then exiles the Ornithopter with Swords to
# Plowshares: it has no counter and nothing attached as it leaves, so the Closet does not trigger and keeps its two counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Costume Closet
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Paradise Mantle
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Disenchant
Swords to Plowshares
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Paradise Mantle.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Costume Closet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle.Activate(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Paradise Mantle
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Costume Closet.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Stack.Count = 0
